## 12. What NOT to Do

- Don't import from `@playwright/test` directly — always from `./fixtures`
- Don't use `page.waitForTimeout()` — use `expect` auto-retry instead
- Don't hardcode credentials or URLs
- Don't use CSS class selectors as first choice — prefer role/label/testid
- Don't skip `waitForLoadState('networkidle')` after navigating to dynamic pages
- Don't log in through UI in every test — use `storageState` via `global-setup.ts`
- Don't use `asyncio.gather`-style patterns — `TaskGroup` is not relevant here, but DO prefer `Promise.all` over sequential awaits for independent async operations
